98dc3236295526d5b23c0a12bc59106f1a.jpg","sourceURL":"https://visit.brussels/fr/visiteurs/agenda/event-detail.5700026212","sourceName":"agenda.brussels","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"bxl-5700024511","title":"Casual/Tease as part of The Memorial to Those Who Did Not Fall in War","category":"art","venueID":"osm-n11958370905","start":"2026-09-09T22:00:00Z","end":"2027-02-21T22:59:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"We think we know what harm looks like. From breaking news to social media, we are saturated with a constant stream of images of victims set against collapsed facades, darkened walls, dust hanging in the air, and streets brought to a halt under rubble. In this flow of images, we learn where to look for casualty and, just as crucially, where not to: within the uninterrupted course of day-to-day routine. Casual/Tease lingers exactly where nothing seems to happen, within the casual continuity of everyday life: a quiet view from a window onto a flowering boulevard, a household ladder leaning within reach, a handmade ceramic vessel ready to hold a bouquet. Each work in Casual/Tease first appears as a small, innocent fragment of daily life, caught in a fleeting moment of ease. Look a little longer, however, and that ease begins to fracture. The window view borrows the gaze of a military drone…","people":[],"isFree":true,"priceFrom":null,"imageURL":"https://agendabrussels2.imgix.net/8829e863a3a892a75ece3a6376990d969cc5971a.jpg","sourceURL":"https://visit.brussels/fr/visiteurs/agenda/event-detail.5700024511","sourceName":"agenda.brussels","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"bxl-5700024362","title":"Tim Braden - 'Contre-jour'","category":"art","venueID":"osm-n10106457017","start":"2026-09-10T22:00:00Z","end":"2026-10-31T22:59:00Z","openingNi